{
  "id": "pgs_sinv_rc_iris_node",
  "display_name": "PGS SINV RC F280039C IRIS Node",
  "description": "Single-phase inverter project requirement prepared from xplt/ctrl_settings.h.\nThis requirement introduces the GMP LVFB 150V 2-phase inverter board as the switching stage and the GMP Harmonia 3-phase LC filter as the grid filter. IRIS F280039C is included as the peripheral option provider.",
